# Upstream skill sets (Make input for agents-skillsets)
#
# One set per line, TAB separated. Blank lines and # comments ignored.
# Format: <name> <repo> <subpath> <prefix> <enabled> <registry_tag> [include]
#
# name:         cache dir ~/.cache/skillsets/<name>
# repo:         git URL (shallow, sparse clone of <subpath> only)
# subpath:      folder holding skills; any dir with SKILL.md up to 2 levels down counts
# prefix:       link name = <prefix><skill>, so links never clash with hub copies
# enabled:      1 = link into ~/.agents/skills, 0 = drift check only
# registry_tag: link text in REGISTRY.md source column, used for drift checks
# include:      optional space separated skill names; omit = all
#
# Install: make agents-skillsets   Check: make agents-skillsets-check

pstack	https://github.com/cursor/plugins	pstack/skills	pstack-	1	pstack
mattpocock	https://github.com/mattpocock/skills	skills	mattpocock-	0	mattpocock/skills
